   SummaryDo you like working as a Warehouse Worker and contribute in a warehouse in Cuijk? In this job you will work in a 2-shift system from Monday to Friday, so you always have your weekends off. You earn up to € 17,62 gross per hour including shift allowance. A great job if you like to work with your hands!
About the jobAs a Warehouse Worker, you start your shift with a short handover, grab a coffee, and get to work. You make sure companies get the right products, on time and in perfect condition.
A typical workday as a Warehouse Worker looks like this:
- You collect orders using an electric pallet truck and check everything carefully;
- You receive incoming goods and place them in the warehouse;
- You prepare orders for shipment so drivers can leave on time;
- You keep the warehouse clean and safe;
- If you want, you can learn to work with a forklift or reach truck!

You work in two shifts:
- Morning shift: 06:00 - 15:00;
- Afternoon shift: 15:00 - 00:00.

You only work on weekdays, so your weekends are free!
What we offer- Hourly wage from € 16,50 gross including shift allowance;
- Growth to up to € 17,62 gross per hour;
- Travel allowance from 10 km (€ 0,23 per km);
- 25 vacation days and 8.33% holiday pay;
- Pension from your first day;
- Training opportunities (like forklift or reach truck certificate for free);
- Personal guidance and chances to grow into roles like supervisor or team leader;
- Weekly or 4-weekly payment (your choice).

What we ask- You speak the Englisch language;
- You have experience in a warehouse.

About the companyYou will work for a reliable logistics company that has been active for almost 100 years in the hospitality and medical equipment industry. With more than 20 locations in the Benelux and over 1,000 employees, it is a big company but feels like a family.
